      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Thank you very much for your enquiry, which shows you have placed your trust in us; however, the BNO085 is not a product from STMicroelectronics, but from the company <a href=\"http://www.ceva-dsp.com\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Ceva DSP</a>. I am very confident that this manufacturer or its forum will be able to provide you with a generic driver in C or C++.</p><p>Good luck!</p><p>Regards<br/>/Peter</p><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p></div>"
